  Fixing damaged armor is rarely worth it.  You generally get 
only one more point of protection from repairing armor.
The same resources used another way should average gaining
two points of protection.


  Start by checking all non-cursed (i.e. blessed or uncursed) 
armor seen so far.  (That's a lot easier when you do it as 
you go along.)  


  What is your actual current armor and naked AC?


  What actual amulets do you have?  (What's unexciting to
you may still be useful.)


